/E (This corresponds to a horizon temperature                   . One very important thing to note here is that this result is completely independent of the field equations\(if any\) satisfied by the metric. So it is in this sense that the temperature of a spacetime horizon is a purely kinematic phenomena and has nothing to do with the dynamics of that spacetime.)
/Pg 36 0 R
/K [20]
>>
