1022 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Boltzmann's insight : The above result is way more general than the case of black hole horizons and extends beyond Rindler frame to all spacetimes equipped with horizons. It tells us that spacetime can get heated for certain class of observers and hence temperature becomes an observer dependent quantity. However, the very fact that you can heat up spacetime implies that it is made up of its own atoms )
/Pg 36 0 R
/K [21 22]
>>
