/E (The UG programme is now almost 15 years old. Although I have not taught an actual undergraduate course, I have had undergrads enroll in the courses I have taken throughout this 15 year period. By and large, the undergraduate students in my class are hardworking and clever. I'm happy that such an audience participates in my courses and is able to engage in them.)
/Pg 54 0 R
