/E (As you may know, the field of HEP has an old history. Some may trace it back to the discovery of the proton/electron i.e. about a century ago. But HEP, as a profession, as employment for a large no. of researchers, owes its real development to the need for countries for developing atomic weapons. So, the funding for HEP increased enormously from the 40s and 50s, all the way through the 60s and 70s. India has had an atomic energy programme since this period. As we needed to understand subnuclear )
